<title>UK: TABLE-EMAP yr pretax profit rises 40 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-EMAP yr pretax profit rises 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		80.4		 vs 24.5</p>
<p> Adjusted earnings/shr  38.9		 vs 27.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.7		  vs 7.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 13.0		 vs 11.2</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	121.1		vs 86.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   768.2		vs 705.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 110 million stg and 120 million. EMAP said the disposal of its newspaper and printing business produced a one-off, pre-tax gain of 113.5 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
